        "Use your server cron manager, cPanel, Plesk, or supervisor to run the Laravel scheduler once every minute. Cron fires on the next minute boundary, so wait about two minutes and refresh this page before changing anything.": "Configura cron en cPanel, Plesk o supervisor para ejecutar el programador de Laravel cada minuto.",
